WEBVTT

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:15.360
"I can't overcome it"  "I'm annoyed"

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.100
Even if I break down those hurdles

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:28.310
No answer emerges

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:34.810
Am I being controlled?  Everyone on the field

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:39.750
Isn't scared, go away, but...

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.450
The unseen road to the future

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:51.200
Cannot be chosen

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.500
Close your eyes and cut with your heart

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.160
just like cards, surely

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.230
It was promised  yes!  you are the winner

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.100
never lose!  Cut with your heart

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.330
just like cards, surely

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:16.680
Because a miracle will occur

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:28.500
Gearfried the Iron Knight

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:43.880
That's...

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:45.800
...Perfectly Ultimate...

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:46.950
...Great Moth.

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:57.100
The real game begins now, Jonouchi.

00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:01.640
Great Moth, attack Alligator's Sword!

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:03.640
Moth Perfect Storm!

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:17.240
Does he have a monster that can defeat that many attack points?

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:20.300
That's a good question, pointy head.

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:21.950
Pointy?

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:32.000
Out of thousands of Duel Monsters cards, only two have more attack points than Perfectly Ultimate Great Moth.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.900
Gate Guardian and Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon.

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:41.880
Jonouchi, I don't think you have those rare cards.

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:45.760
Oh well.  It's no good.

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:49.000
There's no way he can destroy Great Moth.

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:51.420
Even if he believes in himself.

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:55.720
It's fine.  My brother won't give up.

00:02:56.450 --> 00:02:58.100
That's just weird.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:00.310
It was over before it began.

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:04.080
When it comes to school and sports, you gotta have talent.

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:06.900
Those who don't can never succeed.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.330
Is that why you don't want to leave?

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:15.820
While I'm in the hospital, my parents treat me better.

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:18.330
And I don't have to go to school.

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:23.520
In Duel Monsters, a monster's power doesn't determine everything.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.850
I'm counting on you, my deck!

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:32.290
All right!  I have everything I need to fight!

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:34.720
The rest depends on luck.

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:37.160
I set one card!

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:40.010
I switch all my monsters to attack position!

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.400
What?  Attack position?

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:46.900
If Jonouchi is attacked, he'll lose life points!

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:49.540
He's really desperate!

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:52.980
Jonouchi, do you have a plan?

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:55.990
My turn.

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:02.020
Just in case, I set a monster in defense position.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:05.740
Bring it on, Haga!

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:10.190
You want to die that badly?

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:13.640
Then Leghul, attack Jonouchi!

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:17.240
No, wrong one!  I gotta withstand this!

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:21.510
Jonouchi!

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:26.680
I no longer need Parasite Paracide.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.820
This is the end, Jonouchi.

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:33.710
You're done!  Perfectly Ultimate Great Moth, attack Parasite Paracide!

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:36.910
I was waiting for this!

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:37.900
Take this, Haga!

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:40.290
The spell card Skull Dice!

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:49.350
Your monster loses attack points depending on what I roll!

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:55.820
Only two?

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:59.940
Still, Great Moth's attack points are halved!

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:08.140
I knew you were up to something, but that card isn't good enough to defeat Great Moth.

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:09.700
Don't be naive, Haga.

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:12.270
I flip over another set card!

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:15.560
The spell card Graceful Dice!

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:24.900
This spell card increases my monster's attack points depending on what I roll!

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:27.680
Parasite Paracide has 500 attack points.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.340
If I roll a four or higher, I win!

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:30.770
What?

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:33.710
I'll show you my gambling spirit!

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:43.950
Nice!

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:46.100
Paracide's attack points are quadrupled!

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:48.210
It powers up to 2000!

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:50.600
No way!

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:58.200
All right!

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:00.100
He destroyed Great Moth!

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:01.370
Incredible!

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.050
Wow!

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:11.000
Your brother actually destroyed Great Moth even though he only had weak cards!

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:15.120
I end my turn.

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:17.690
How dare you!

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:20.430
How dare you destroy my Great Moth!

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:25.300
Jonouchi!  I'll never forgive you!

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:27.230
You're all talk!

00:06:27.230 --> 00:06:30.230
Your trump card went to the graveyard.

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.230
Don't get overconfident.

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:36.270
My Super Insect Deck has another trump card.

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:38.440
Another trump card?

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:41.360
A card better than Great Moth.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:43.480
My turn!

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:46.480
I summon Insect Soldiers of the Sky.

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:52.660
I play this spell card!

00:06:57.370 --> 00:07:02.000
This spell card destroys one Insect Card.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:05.770
But Jonouchi, I'm not going to destroy your monster.

00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:07.470
Instead...

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:14.630
What's that?

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:19.460
When it goes to the graveyard, he can Special Summon a monster from his hand.

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:20.680
What?  Are you gonna...

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:23.940
Yes.  I'm destroying it!

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:32.600
And I Special Summon the highest Level Insect monster from my hand!

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:34.000
Insect Queen!

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:39.600
I never thought I'd have to use this card against the likes of you.

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:42.170
Come out, my queen!

00:07:58.370 --> 00:07:59.940
Insect Queen!

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:03.130
But it has fewer attack points than Great Moth.

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:05.980
Are you sure?

00:08:06.140 --> 00:08:11.770
Insect Queen gains attack points for every Insect on the field.

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:16.240
Including the Insects on your field, Jonouchi.

00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:17.170
What?

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:22.480
Since you worked hard to protect Paracide, my Queen powers up!

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:29.760
What?

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:30.660
Oh no!

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:37.440
This is the real reason why Insector Haga changed all the monsters into insects.

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:41.920
He already had this planned even when he summoned Great Moth.

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:50.220
Even though he destroyed Great Moth, he has to face another incredible monster!

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:54.880
He has no chance because the opponent has strong cards.

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:58.820
Even if you try, you can't change anything if you have weak cards.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:00.880
Things can change.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:06.330
Thanks to my brother, I'll be able to see.

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:14.860
I didn't believe in myself, so I didn't want to get eye surgery.

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:19.040
But my brother encouraged me.

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.550
The surgery was a success.

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:30.750
When my bandages come off, the first thing I want to see is my brother duel.

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:34.080
I want to see my brother duel heroically!

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:38.540
I'll believe in myself.

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:43.160
When I cheer for him, I know he can hear me!

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:45.090
What if it still doesn't help?

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:49.820
Then I'll have no regrets.

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:51.930
Because I did my best.

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:57.950
Get ready, Jonouchi!

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:59.820
I tribute Leghul!

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:06.280
It ate its own ally!

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:08.520
Attack, my Queen!

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:10.760
Queen's Hell Breath!

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:19.260
Little-Winguard is destroyed.

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:26.600
When Insect Queen destroys your monster, it lays an egg.

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:33.580
I'll fill the field with these cute babies.

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:40.260
Damn!  It can create its own Insect monsters!

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:44.290
I can't let him get more Insect monsters.

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:48.880
But I can't attack as long as he has that Barrier.

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:55.400
Even if I summon a new monster, it'll turn into an Insect and raise Insect Queen's attack points.

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:57.850
What should I do?

00:10:58.880 --> 00:10:59.830
My turn.

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:04.570
I'll set one card and end my turn.

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:07.470
No, Jonouchi!

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:10.320
You forgot to switch your monsters to defense!

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:12.520
Too late.

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:15.570
You already ended your turn.

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:18.160
Your monsters remain in attack position.

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:23.130
This is bad.  If Jonouchi is attacked, he'll have 0 life points!

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:24.660
My turn.

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:27.280
I summon Cockroach Knight!

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:34.540
When it's sent to the graveyard, it returns to the top of my deck.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.440
So I can keep offering it to Insect Queen!

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:38.370
What?

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.820
Let's go, my Queen!

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:42.980
Attack Panther Warrior!

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:45.250
You're done. Jonouchi.

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:46.720
I tricked you, Haga.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:47.280
What?

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:50.220
What do you think this set card is?

00:11:50.840 --> 00:11:52.710
It's a trap?

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:55.660
You pretended to forget to switch your cards to defense!

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:57.160
Exactly!

00:11:57.160 --> 00:12:00.600
I'm using the same tricks you used!

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:04.500
I activate the trap Magic-Arm Shield!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.270
It caught Insect Soldiers of the Sky!

00:12:10.270 --> 00:12:13.280
Insect Queen will attack Insect Soldiers of the Sky!

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:26.220
Insect Soldiers is destroyed!

00:12:31.380 --> 00:12:32.660
Unbelievable!

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:35.120
He escaped trouble again!

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:39.400
Hang in there, big brother!

00:12:59.390 --> 00:13:01.800
Good.  He survived.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.830
But how will he destroy Insect Queen?

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:10.630
I managed to survive, but I can't summon a monster nor attack.

00:13:10.630 --> 00:13:13.280
My situation hasn't improved.

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:17.960
Jonouchi, give up already.

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:23.720
I know your deck is made of Warriors and Beast-Warriors.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:26.880
They have no immunity against my Paracide.

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:30.100
I can't do anything this turn.

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:33.320
I switch my monsters to defense position and end my turn.

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:37.900
You're out of options.

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:40.360
I'll finish you nice and slow.

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:41.360
My turn.

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:43.730
I summon Cockroach Knight.

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:49.040
Attack, my Queen!

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:50.540
Queen's Hell Breath!

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:00.380
Panther Warrior is destroyed!

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:06.850
Since I switched Paracide to defense position, Haga won't attack it.

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:10.930
He's leaving it on my field so that he can turn my monsters into bugs.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:15.770
I can't use Magic-Arm Shield anymore.

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:20.150
At this rate, I'll definitely have 0 life points next turn.

00:14:22.970 --> 00:14:28.480
Is this ugly monster sealing my fate?

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:31.550
Hang in there, Jonouchi!  Don't give up!

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:39.820
I don't know how to get out of this.

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:44.020
Jonouchi, it's not like you to give up!

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:49.330
I thought you were going to become a true duelist and duel Yugi!

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:50.970
A true duelist!

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:56.400
Jonouchi, I'll hold on to this card until then.

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:57.860
That's right.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:03.080
I promised Yugi and Red-Eyes that when I became a true duelist...

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:06.010
Let's duel when that time comes.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:11.950
Try harder, bro!

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:13.390
Believe in yourself!

00:15:13.500 --> 00:15:14.760
Kenta...

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:18.490
If he wins, I think I can try harder too!

00:15:18.490 --> 00:15:21.330
So let's root for him together!

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:23.270
Okay!

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.600
Go for it!

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:27.500
Hang in there, Jonouchi!

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:30.170
Don't let bug boy beat you!

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:31.320
Jonouchi!

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:32.920
Jonouchi!

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:34.100
Jonouchi!

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:35.550
I won't give up.

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:38.200
I will find an opening!

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:39.900
I draw!

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:42.480
This card...

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:47.860
The goddess of victory hasn't forsaken me yet.

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:49.860
It's useless.

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:53.230
None of your monsters are immune to Paracide.

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:57.870
I set one card and summon Gearfried the Iron Knight!

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:09.310
You fool!  Paracide will take care of that Warrior-Type monster!

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:11.250
Go, Parasite Paracide!

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:23.090
What?

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:26.030
Paracide can't infect it?

00:16:26.030 --> 00:16:28.460
Gearfried is a knight encased in iron.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:32.400
Your parasite can't live in iron.

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:34.070
An iron knight?

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.440
Well done, Jonouchi!

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:40.510
Paracide infects its host, so it's treated like an Equip Card.

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:45.450
Gearfried's iron body doesn't accept Equip Cards.

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:49.890
I get it!  If it doesn't turn into an insect, it can pass through the barrier!

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:54.480
Haga, your Queen has a major weak point.

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:56.760
I'll prove it.

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:57.930
What?

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:00.240
Go, Gearfried!

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:02.530
Attack Insect Queen's egg!

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:04.370
Iron Smash!

00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:12.890
Damn!  He's going after the eggs!

00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:13.740
Nice!

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:14.610
Jonouchi!

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:19.050
Jonouchi discovered the insect combo's greatest weakness.

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:23.770
It's due to Insect Queen's own abilities.

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:29.990
To increase its attack points, Insect Queen lays an egg when it destroys a monster.

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:32.430
But the egg is unprotected.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:37.360
Since the egg has few attack points, I can attack it to deal you big damage.

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:43.800
You turned my monsters into bugs so that you could protect your eggs with Insect Barrier.

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:50.000
Jonouchi, you're still history if you can't stop my attack next turn.

00:17:51.180 --> 00:17:54.720
You'll pay for angering the Queen.

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:59.750
I'll strike you with Queen's Impact, my Super Insect Deck's strongest combo!

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:01.100
My turn!

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:02.750
I summon Soldier Ant!

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:06.460
And I activate the spell card Multiplication of Ants!

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:19.660
What's this?

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:26.150
This spell card multiplies one Soldier Ant into ten for one turn.

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:29.080
Do you know what this means, Jonouchi?

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:33.740
Insect Queen gains attack points for every Insect on the field.

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:36.550
That's right.

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:39.070
The Queen's attack points are now...

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:41.650
4800!

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:45.020
This is bad.

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:47.830
If Gearfried is destroyed, Jonouchi loses!

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:51.540
Jonouchi, my Queen attacks you!

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:53.960
Queen's Impact!

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:58.580
Don't lose!

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:00.220
Big brother...

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:05.380
Haga, the duel is already over.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:06.510
What?

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:08.590
You lost.

00:19:08.820 --> 00:19:12.000
I activate the trap card Graverobber!

00:19:15.640 --> 00:19:17.160
Graverobber?

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:17.930
Yeah.

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:20.870
The card I'm taking from your graveyard is...

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.640
I really don't like bugs.

00:19:33.780 --> 00:19:36.950
Yeah!  Insect Queen is destroyed!

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:39.380
My Queen!

00:19:39.560 --> 00:19:40.700
My turn!

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:43.880
Gearfried, attack the monster egg!

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:01.880
Hooray!

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:03.480
Jonouchi won!

00:20:03.480 --> 00:20:04.680
Well done!

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:09.880
Give me two Puzzle Cards and two rare cards like you promised.

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:11.080
Oh no...

00:20:11.530 --> 00:20:16.060
And there's something that I've been waiting to say to you.

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:19.760
You're weak.

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:27.910
Wow!  Your brother is awesome!

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:31.200
He beat a really powerful opponent!

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:33.570
Hey lady!

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:35.810
I'll go to school.

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:38.620
I'll believe in myself.

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:40.900
I want to be like your brother!

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:42.480
I want to change!

00:20:42.830 --> 00:20:44.040
Kenta!

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:50.960
But in exchange, introduce me to your brother the next time you see him.

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:53.360
I want him to be my brother!

00:20:54.220 --> 00:20:56.800
I promise to introduce you to him.

00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:59.270
Hooray!  That's a promise!

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:00.000
Yeah!

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:04.200
Whoa!  Insector Haga lost!

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:06.240
To a nobody!

00:21:06.560 --> 00:21:09.670
Jonouchi won.  He did it.

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:14.050
I know I'll be returning this card to you soon.

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:16.850
I can't afford to lose.

00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:24.500
Anyway, where's the silent puppet that Marik was talking about?

00:21:42.680 --> 00:21:47.320
The frozen mime in the plaza suddenly started moving!

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:53.880
Without a mind of his own, Marik controls the mime to stand in Yugi's way.

00:21:54.110 --> 00:21:58.710
When Marik said, "Beware of the silent puppet," he was talking about him.

00:21:58.910 --> 00:22:04.710
Does that mean he's a Rare Hunter with the second Egyptian God Card, Slifer the Sky Dragon?

00:22:05.020 --> 00:22:08.060
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Marik Makes His Move  God Combo

00:22:08.240 --> 00:22:09.710
Duel, standby!

00:22:23.700 --> 00:22:28.200
Even a long, long time ago

00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:33.570
I feel like I've been here

00:22:34.100 --> 00:22:43.230
The setting sun colors the classroom after school

00:22:43.540 --> 00:22:54.740
We all laugh as you point out that I cut my bangs too short

00:22:57.630 --> 00:23:02.270
Time passes bit by bit

00:23:02.930 --> 00:23:07.540
The time when my bangs touch my eyelids

00:23:08.100 --> 00:23:12.620
Will never change

00:23:13.310 --> 00:23:17.890
The sunset envelops everyone

00:23:18.550 --> 00:23:23.120
To be who I am

00:23:23.720 --> 00:23:28.360
I've kept searching for something

00:23:29.020 --> 00:23:33.040
The time that we're now spending together

00:23:33.040 --> 00:23:36.000
I learned that's the answer

00:23:36.800 --> 00:23:43.110
From now until forever...
